     ],
     "text": "Blue Trainer Bellows Drill"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b3",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "Blue Trainer Bellows Drill",
     "hash": "2d8a728981193c8f5cbf4aeb",
     "box": [
      72,
      121.4,
      435.9,
      26.4
     ],
     "text": "Protocol RT-TRAIN-014 · Revision 1 · Effective 1 June 2026 · Issued by the Lakeside Training Hospital Respiratory Education Committee (a fictional body)."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b4",
     "kind": "heading",
     "under": null,
     "hash": "cfb137e08bf1c969ff218611",
     "box": [
      72,
      164.3,
      66.5,
      15.3
     ],
     "text": "1. Purpose"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b5",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "1. Purpose",
     "hash": "2e71e2c3afc395a6db3fda80",
     "box": [
      72,
      188.4,
      466.3,
      40.4
     ],
     "text": "This invented protocol exists only to test Department Hub. It describes a classroom drill on the Blue Trainer bellows, a device that does not exist. Rates are counted in marks per minute (mk/min), a unit made up for this document."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b6",
     "kind": "heading",
     "under": null,
     "hash": "26c8c88741023591c41cc9ff",
     "box": [
      72,
      245.3,
      147.4,
      15.3
     ],
     "text": "2. Who may run the drill"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b7",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "2. Who may run the drill",
     "hash": "873ceab3308aa4d609b13982",
     "box": [
      72,
      269.4,
      456.9,
      26.4
     ],
     "text": "Only a therapist who holds a current Blue Trainer card may run the drill. A student may run the drill only while a card holder is present in the room."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b8",
     "kind": "heading",
     "under": null,
     "hash": "e0bbd8c576dc461a64dfad41",
     "box": [
      72,
      312.3,
      76.6,
      15.3
     ],
     "text": "3. Drill order"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b9",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "3. Drill order",
     "hash": "1bb27a8a00bb94bf706ade7b",
     "box": [
      72,
      336.4,
      466.8,
      26.4
     ],
     "text": "A written drill order from the Simulation Lead is required before the drill is started. A verbal request is not a drill order."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b10",
     "kind": "text",
     "running": true,
     "under": null,
     "hash": "399c66e39923afd28901b85a",
     "box": [
