        "5 minutes"
       ],
       "text": "Age band: Pediatric (under 18 years) · Starting rate: 6 mk/min · Highest rate: 10 mk/min · Recheck after: 5 minutes"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p2.b4",
     "kind": "heading",
     "under": null,
     "hash": "86e8ecad39e4e447c36dabc0",
     "box": [
      72,
      192.3,
      75.1,
      15.3
     ],
     "text": "5. Adult drill"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p2.b5",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "5. Adult drill",
     "hash": "5cd5da3fa8aa2b463effdfb6",
     "box": [
      72,
      216.4,
      447.6,
      26.4
     ],
     "text": "For an adult manikin, start the bellows at 12 mk/min. At each recheck, raise the rate by 2 mk/min while the green lamp stays lit. Never set an adult rate above 20 mk/min."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p2.b6",
     "kind": "heading",
     "under": null,
     "hash": "195c488ff4912bd75a67b9ba",
     "box": [
      72,
      259.3,
      96.8,
      15.3
     ],
     "text": "6. Pediatric drill"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p2.b7",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "6. Pediatric drill",
     "hash": "2d7c995d17aa7155e256b57b",
     "box": [
      72,
      283.4,
      451.1,
      26.4
     ],
     "text": "For a pediatric manikin, fit the small cuff and start the bellows at 6 mk/min. At each recheck, raise the rate by 1 mk/min while the green lamp stays lit. Never set a pediatric rate above 10 mk/min."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p2.b8",
     "kind": "text",
     "running": true,
     "under": null,
     "hash": "399c66e39923afd28901b85a",
     "box": [
